# The LLM agent tab (run by tests/t_ui.sh) with the mock model: a question
# that reads a file, one that searches, a path:line link in the answer
# opening the file there; the chat is kept in VXIDE_STATE_DIR.
key ctrl+shift+p
type View: Show LLM Agent
key Return
wait 200
type What does src/main.c do?
key Return
wait 500
type where is answer used?
key Return
wait 500
click 352 757
wait 100
expect file src/main.c
expect line 3
